# NEVER commit the hidden benchmark. It must not be uploaded anywhere - not to a
# public repo, not to a private one. Its only permitted locations are local disk
# and the internal evaluation server. It is what leaderboard submissions are
# scored against, so if it were public a model could be tuned on it.
secret_data.jsonl
secret_dataset*
secret_*
*hidden*

# No datasets or model predictions in this repo. Datasets live in
# nl2graphql-bench/datasets; predictions are an input you supply locally.
*.jsonl
*.jsonl.gz
*.xlsx
*.parquet
*.csv
2026_evals/
2026_input/
2026_results/
2024_evals/
emnlp_inputs/
emnlp_outputs/
every_prediction/
review_evals/
test_input_files/
test_output_files/

# Never commit a virtualenv or credentials.
.venv/
venv/
env/
.env
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
config.local.yaml

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
